<!ELEMENT TileRegistry (TileData+)>

<!ELEMENT TileData ANY>
<!ATTLIST TileData id ID #REQUIRED>
<!ATTLIST TileData name CDATA #REQUIRED>
<!ATTLIST TileData texturePath CDATA #REQUIRED>

<!ELEMENT AnimationFrames (Frame+)>
